# Expectation record for 12_preprocessor/001_macro_expansion_stringize.c
#
# Reproduce one cell by hand with no harness: render the three command templates
# below, substituting the target triple, the optimization level, the source path,
# the output path, and the target's runner (empty on the natively executing target).

program            = 001_macro_expansion_stringize
area               = 12_preprocessor
description        = Function-like macro expansion with stringize (#) and token paste (##), asserted by printing the resulting strings and values
targets            = x86_64, i686, aarch64, riscv64
opt_levels         = -O0, -O1, -O2
shared_flags       = -static
bcc_command        = $BCC --target <triple> <opt> -static <src> -o <out>
ref_command        = $REF_CC_<TRIPLE> <opt> -static <src> -o <out>
run_command        = <runner> <out>
expect_exit        = 0
oracle_a           = enabled
oracle_b           = enabled
oracle_c           = enabled
ub_notes           <<END
Free of undefined and unspecified behaviour by construction, which is the precondition that
makes a divergence here evidence about a compiler at all: a program containing undefined
behaviour licenses every implementation to do anything, so a difference between two of them
would prove nothing about either.

Arithmetic: every value computed and printed is a small non-negative int, and the largest
intermediate anywhere in the program is 25, so no signed overflow can arise on any target. No
shift operator appears, so no shift count can be negative or at or above the promoted operand's
width. Neither division nor remainder is performed anywhere, so neither a zero divisor nor the
one signed division that overflows can occur.

Objects: every object read is initialised at its own declaration, or is one of the two
file-scope static const int objects with an explicit initialiser, so no uninitialised storage
is ever read. The volatile int source is initialised to 4 and read exactly once, into a plain
int local, in a statement of its own; the function-like macro under test then expands that
plain local twice, so both of its reads are pure and identical and no unsequenced volatile
access can arise. No object is modified twice between sequence points.

Pointers and aggregates: the only pointer in the program is the const char * parameter of the
local slen helper, which reads a string literal from index 0 up to and including the test of
its terminating null character and stops there. The one-past-the-end position is formed by no
expression and read by none, no pointer arithmetic crosses an object boundary, and no aliasing
violation is possible because the sole object read through a pointer is an array of char read
as char. No string literal is written to. No aggregate, union or bitfield is read, so nothing
depends on a padding byte or on the relative addresses of unrelated objects.

Calls: no argument expression of any call has a side effect, so nothing depends on unspecified
evaluation order and the rule of at most one side-effecting argument per call holds trivially.
printf is declared with a prototype that matches every use, and each conversion specification
matches the type of its argument after the default argument promotions: %s takes a string
literal and %d takes an int. Those two specifiers are the only ones used.

Determinism, which byte-exact comparison requires: the output is a fixed 13-line sequence
of name=value pairs, exactly one line per preprocessing property claimed, so a single
divergent line localises a defect to one construct. No address or pointer value is printed.
No plain char value is printed, so the measured plain-char signedness difference between the
targets cannot be observed. Only int and string values are printed, so the measured i686
width difference cannot reach the compared bytes either. No translation-date,
translation-time or source-file-name predefined macro is referenced, no floating type
appears, there is no randomness and no locale-dependent formatting, and nothing outside the
program is read: every value printed comes from a literal in its own source, so execution is
hermetic. main returns 0, inside the 0-125 range the suite requires.

The two-variant rule: the funclike_folded and funclike_runtime lines apply the SAME
function-like macro twice, once to a literal, where the constant folder answers, and once to an
operand sourced from volatile storage, which the optimiser may not fold. Without the second
variant, optimisation would substitute the folder's answer for the backend's at -O1 and -O2 and
a code-generation defect would escape detection entirely. That the volatile variant really does
reach the backend was verified rather than assumed: at -O2 the native build materialises the
multiply as a genuine instruction rather than folding it to an immediate.

No header is included, and printf is hand-declared for that reason: the compiler under test
bundles freestanding headers only and ships no stdio.h, so an include of it would succeed on
the reference side and fail on the compiler-under-test side, manufacturing a divergence caused
by the test rather than by the compiler.

No deviation from the default warning gate is requested, and none is needed. The full default
gate -Wall -Wextra -pedantic -Wconversion -Wsign-conversion -Wshadow -Werror produces zero
diagnostics in the single native compile-only invocation the suite makes of it; the sanitizer
gate -fsanitize=undefined,address -fno-sanitize-recover=all builds, runs to completion and
exits 0 with no diagnostic in its one instrumented native build; and all twelve cells of the
declared matrix produce byte-identical stdout with exit status 0 and an empty standard error.
END
impl_defined_notes <<END
This record narrows nothing. It declares all four targets, all three optimization levels, all
three oracles and the default warning gate, so it excuses no exclusion and no comparison is
withheld. What follows is the other thing this field is for: the implementation-defined
properties the program was written to keep out of its output, which is what makes the full
four-way cross-backend comparison sound rather than merely permitted.

1. Pointer and long width. sizeof(long) and sizeof(void *) are 4 bytes on i686 and 8 bytes on
   x86_64, aarch64 and riscv64, i686 being the one ELF32 target
   (docs/technical-specifications.md lines 457-462). No long, no pointer value, no size_t and
   no ptrdiff_t is printed anywhere, and no length modifier for any of them is used, so the
   difference cannot reach the compared bytes.
2. Plain char signedness. It is implementation-defined, and was measured signed on x86_64 and
   i686 and unsigned on aarch64 and riscv64. No plain char value is printed. The only char
   objects here are string literals, consumed either as whole strings by %s or by comparison
   against the null character inside slen, and neither observes signedness.
3. long double representation. It differs across the four targets, measured at 16, 12, 16 and
   16 bytes, x87 80-bit against IEEE binary128. No floating type of any kind appears in this
   program; that property belongs to 13_floating_point/004_long_double_target_restricted,
   which is the one program permitted to narrow a comparison on its account.
4. Byte order. All four targets are little-endian (docs/technical-specifications.md lines
   457-462) and no byte-order-sensitive value is printed, so nothing here depends on it.

Every construct the program exercises is documented as supported: object-like and
function-like macro expansion with stringification and token pasting at
docs/technical-specifications.md line 92, the same two operators plus the recursive expansion
guard at line 491, and the same list in docs/project-guide.md's "C11 Frontend -- Preprocessor"
row. This record therefore
carries no expected-divergence marker, and a divergence under any of its three oracles is a
genuine finding rather than an expected one.
END
expected_stdout    <<END
stringize_direct=WIDTH
stringize_expanded=32
stringize_expression=a + b * 2
stringize_length=5
paste_identifier=55
paste_both_expanded=55
paste_number=12
stringize_of_paste=32
funclike_folded=25
funclike_runtime=16
funclike_nested=14
empty_object_macro=8
self_reference_guard=9
END
